  "comments": "<p>There are coins with a large rim and coins with a small rim.<br><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/5bf72cd220212.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/5bf72cd220212.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a></p><p>The <strong>Balearic Islands</strong> (Catalan: Illes Balears; Spanish: Islas Baleares) are an archipelago in the western Mediterranean Sea, near the eastern coast of the Iberian Peninsula. The archipelago forms a province and autonomous community of Spain, with Palma de Mallorca being its capital and largest city.</p>",
